span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">袖长不定的夏末</text><text for="L2">在破晓电车上晃荡 忽然想起</text><text for="L3">那片令人怀念的风景</text><text for="L4">无数次反复绕远路</text><text for="L5">相似的街景只是匆匆掠过</text><text for="L6">车窗上倒映着我</text><text for="L7">你是否现在还跟那时一样呢</text><text for="L8">骑着那辆歪歪扭扭的自行车四处奔跑</text><text for="L9">荒唐的走钢丝 膝盖渗出的血</text><text for="L10">此刻却莫名无比空虚</text><text for="L11">无论身高改变了多少</text><text for="L12">愿有什么永不改变</text><text for="L13">被无谓的往日面容鼓励着</text><text for="L14">现在也歌唱现在也歌唱现在也歌唱</text><text for="L15">啦啦啦啦 啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L16">在穿行于闹市的出租车里</text><text for="L17">茫然倚坐着打了个喷嚏</text><text for="L18">眺望窗外</text><text for="L19">那个让心颤抖的瞬间</text><text for="L20">多想能再次遇见 我如此渴望</text><text for="L21">绝不会忘记</text><text for="L22">你是否现在还跟那时一样呢</text><text for="L23">把一只鞋掉进树丛里到处寻找</text><text for="L24">说着“无论发生什么我们都一定能好起来”</text><text for="L25">天真欢笑着的日子 我仍记得</text><text for="L26">无论多么狼狈地受伤</text><text for="L27">给无尽的日常献上花束</text><text for="L28">追逐着无谓的往日面容</text><text for="L29">现在也歌唱现在也歌唱现在也歌唱</text><text for="L30">啦啦啦啦 啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L31">日出前的残月</text><text for="L32">你是否也在某处看着呢</text><text for="L33">莫名地 胸口阵阵发疼</text><text for="L34">模糊的面容 朦胧的色彩</text><text for="L35">事到如今想为悲伤呼喊</text><text for="L36">是否一切都已经太迟了</text><text for="L37">若能从零开始重新走过</text><text for="L38">想在擦肩而过时遇见你</text><text for="L39">无论身高改变了多少</text><text for="L40">愿有什么永不改变</text><text for="L41">被无谓的往日面容鼓励着</text><text for="L42">现在也歌唱现在也歌唱现在也歌唱</text><text for="L43">啦啦啦啦 啦啦啦啦</text><text for="L44">日出前的残月</text><text for="L45">你是否也在某处看着呢</text><text for="L46">迎来能笑着面对一无所有的朝阳</text><text for="L47">起始是蓝色</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="05:23.239"><div begin="00:11.659" end="01:13.688" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:11.659" end="00:16.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:11.659" end="00:12.763">袖丈</span><span begin="00:12.763" end="00:13.147">が</span><span begin="00:13.147" end="00:14.432">覚束ない</span><span begin="00:14.432" end="00:14.935">夏</span><span begin="00:14.935" end="00:15.438">の</span><span begin="00:15.880" end="00:16.963">終わり</span></p><p begin="00:17.634" end="00:23.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:17.634" end="00:18.691">明け方</span><span begin="00:18.691" end="00:19.091">の</span><span begin="00:19.091" end="00:19.747">電車</span><span begin="00:19.747" end="00:20.075">に</span><span begin="00:20.075" end="00:21.032">揺られ</span><span begin="00:21.032" end="00:21.351">て</span><span begin="00:21.577" end="00:23.941">思い出した</span></p><p begin="00:24.307" end="00:28.783" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:24.307" end="00:26.121">懐かしい</span><span begin="00:26.121" end="00:26.886">あの</span><span begin="00:26.886" end="00:28.783">風景</span></p><p begin="00:30.959" end="00:36.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:30.959" end="00:32.058">たくさん</span><span begin="00:32.058" end="00:32.407">の</span><span begin="00:32.407" end="00:33.335">遠回り</span><span begin="00:33.335" end="00:33.715">を</span><span begin="00:33.715" end="00:35.474">繰り返し</span><span begin="00:35.474" end="00:36.160">て</span></p><p begin="00:36.909" end="00:43.202" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:36.909" end="00:37.853">同じ</span><span begin="00:37.853" end="00:38.220">よう</span><span begin="00:38.220" end="00:38.403">な</span><span begin="00:38.403" end="00:39.441">街並み</span><span begin="00:39.441" end="00:39.787">が</span><span begin="00:39.787" end="00:40.433">ただ</span><span begin="00:40.888" end="00:43.202">通り過ぎた</span></p><p begin="00:43.549" end="00:48.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:43.549" end="00:44.095">窓</span><span begin="00:44.095" end="00:44.640">に</span><span begin="00:44.640" end="00:45.215">僕</span><span begin="00:45.215" end="00:45.789">が</span><span begin="00:45.789" end="00:47.256">映っ</span><span begin="00:47.256" end="00:48.210">てる</span></p><p begin="00:49.855" end="00:54.615" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:49.855" end="00:50.134">君</span><span begin="00:50.134" end="00:50.413">は</span><span begin="00:50.413" end="00:50.691">今</span><span begin="00:50.691" end="00:50.970">も</span><span begin="00:51.292" end="00:51.715">あの</span><span begin="00:51.715" end="00:51.927">頃</span><span begin="00:51.927" end="00:52.562">みたい</span><span begin="00:52.562" end="00:52.774">に</span><span begin="00:52.774" end="00:53.140">いる</span><span begin="00:53.140" end="00:53.324">の</span><span begin="00:53.324" end="00:53.873">だろう</span><span begin="00:53.873" end="00:54.615">か</span></p><p begin="00:55.772" end="01:00.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:55.772" end="00:56.429">ひしゃげ</span><span begin="00:56.429" end="00:56.594">て</span><span begin="00:56.594" end="00:57.251">曲がった</span><span begin="00:57.251" end="00:57.751">あの</span><span begin="00:57.751" end="00:58.250">自転</span><span begin="00:58.250" end="00:58.500">車</span><span begin="00:58.500" end="00:58.750">で</span><span begin="00:58.750" end="01:00.504">走り回った</span></p><p begin="01:01.737" end="01:07.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:01.737" end="01:03.188">馬鹿ばかしい</span><span begin="01:03.188" end="01:04.325">綱渡り </span><span begin="01:04.617" end="01:04.906">膝</span><span begin="01:04.906" end="01:05.194">に</span><span begin="01:05.614" end="01:06.886">滲んだ</span><span begin="01:06.886" end="01:07.616">血</span></p><p begin="01:07.656" end="01:13.688" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:07.656" end="01:07.909">今</span><span begin="01:07.909" end="01:08.162">は</span><span begin="01:08.162" end="01:09.642">なんだ</span><span begin="01:09.642" end="01:10.255">か</span><span begin="01:10.532" end="01:11.065">ひどく</span><span begin="01:11.065" end="01:13.688">虚しい</span></p></div><div begin="01:17.604" end="01:46.787" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="01:17.604" end="01:23.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:17.604" end="01:18.224">どれ</span><span begin="01:18.224" end="01:19.612">だけ</span><span begin="01:19.801" end="01:20.852">背丈</span><span begin="01:20.852" end="01:21.378">が</span><span begin="01:21.378" end="01:22.651">変わろう</span><span begin="01:22.651" end="01:23.540">とも</span></p><p begin="01:23.556" end="01:29.618" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:23.556" end="01:24.457">変わら</span><span begin="01:24.457" end="01:25.708">ない</span><span begin="01:25.708" end="01:26.473">何</span><span begin="01:26.473" end="01:26.832">か</span><span begin="01:26.832" end="01:27.191">が</span><span begin="01:27.191" end="01:28.667">あります</span><span begin="01:28.667" end="01:28.956">よう</span><span begin="01:28.956" end="01:29.618">に</span></p><p begin="01:29.630" end="01:35.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:29.630" end="01:30.361">くだら</span><span begin="01:30.361" end="01:31.681">ない</span><span begin="01:31.681" end="01:32.780">面影</span><span begin="01:32.780" end="01:33.329">に</span><span begin="01:33.329" end="01:34.652">励まさ</span><span begin="01:34.652" end="01:35.465">れ</span></p><p begin="01:35.802" end="01:40.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:35.802" end="01:36.076">今</span><span begin="01:36.076" end="01:36.350">も</span><span begin="01:36.350" end="01:37.235">歌う</span><span begin="01:37.235" end="01:37.551">今</span><span begin="01:37.551" end="01:37.867">も</span><span begin="01:37.867" end="01:38.718">歌う</span><span begin="01:38.718" end="01:39.002">今</span><span begin="01:39.002" end="01:39.286">も</span><span begin="01:39.286" end="01:40.680">歌う</span></p><p begin="01:41.707" end="01:46.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:41.707" end="01:43.156">Lalalala </span><span begin="01:43.156" end="01:44.622">lalalala </span><span begin="01:44.622" end="01:46.787">lalalala</span></p></div><div begin="01:59.842" end="03:01.970" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="01:59.842" end="02:05.428" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:59.842